  (gr_text "ASSEMBLY\n1 DECK: BREAK OUT THE KNOCKOUT,\n  FILE THE NUBS FLUSH\n2 FACES TO DECK + END PLATE\n  FIRST, ON THE BARE BOARDS\n3 CLEAN (IPA)\n4 J1 + J2, THEN THE XIAOS\n5 RP-SMAS, COAX, TIE MOUNTS\n6 SPLITTER LEAD TO J2" (at 47.759618 108.799038 -240) (layer "F.SilkS") (tstamp 95a21b67-fd4c-486c-a220-a3edac1a66a6)
